- SDIO

    | Type  | Desc.        | Dir. | Port | PadCell  | Index |
    |-------|--------------|------|------|----------|-------|
    | Clock | SDIO_CLK(BS) | O    | MC13 | NVT TSIO | E6    |
    | Data  | SDIO_CMD(BS) | IO   | MC14 | NVT TSIO | E7    |
    | Data  | SDIO_D0(BS)  | IO   | MC15 | NVT TSIO | E8    |
    | Data  | SDIO_D1(BS)  | IO   | MC16 | NVT TSIO | E9    |
    | Data  | SDIO_D2(BS)  | IO   | MC17 | NVT TSIO | E10   |
    | Data  | SDIO_D3(BS)  | IO   | MC18 | NVT TSIO | E11   |

    set SDIO_PADCLK_O [get_ports {MC13}]
    set SDIO_PORT_I   [get_ports {MC14 MC17 MC18}]
    set SDIO_PORT_O   [get_ports {MC14 MC17 MC18}]

    set SDIO_DATA_H [get_ports {MC15 MC16}]

